              "content": {
                "html": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">Applications should include:</span></p><ul><li><p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">A description of the proposed activity</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">A full estimate of the costs involved</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">Details of any additional funding</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">A letter of support from your Head of Department or Line Manager</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">Confirmation of current BNMS membership</span></p></li></ul><p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">Applications should be submitted to:</span></p><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"mailto:rtng@bnms.org.uk\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">rtng@bnms.org.uk</span></a></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">Applications for 2026 are currently being accepted.</span></p><p></p>",
